  "text": "File No.P .39012/5/2018-L&R Government of India Ministry of Commerce and Industry Department for Promotion of Industry and Internal Trade (L&R Section) Udyog Bhawan , New Delhi Dated the 1?1h January, 2020 OFFICE MEMORANDUM Subject: Pneumatic Tyres and Tubes for Automotive Vehicles (Quality Control) Order, 2009 - regarding . The undersigned is directed to say that as per provisions contained under sub- clause (a) to (f) of Clause 3 of the \"Pneumatic Tyres and Tubes for Automotive (Quality Control) Order, 2009\", certain categories of tyres have been exempted from the application of the provisions of the said Quality Control Order, 2009. In pursuance of the Sub-Clause (f) of Clause 3 of said Order, 2009, a Committee was constituted to finalize the list of tyres not manufactured domestically and imported by the Original Equipment Manufacturers (OEMs) for selling in replacement market through their authorized dealers. 2. The Committee has finalized a list of 669 tyre sizes and types of tyres which are not manufactured domestically and can be imported by the original Equipment Manufacturers (OEMs) only. The list of 669 such tyres is enclosed herewith. The size and type of tyres are specified in the list. A copy of the list of tyres can also be obtained from the website of this Department https://dipp.gov.in. 3. This issues with the approval of competent authority. Encl: as above (Arun Kumar) Under Secretary to the Government of India e.mail:a.kumar62@nic.in 1. Central Board of Indirect Taxes and Customs(CBIC)(Kind Attention : Shri L. Satya Srinivas, Joint Secretary (Customs), Department of Revenue, North Block, New Delhi 110 001. (Fax: 011 2309 3475) 2. Bureau of Indian Standards (Kind Attention : Shri P.K. Tiwari , Director General (DG) , Manak Bhawan, 9, Bahadur Shah Zafar Marg, New Dehi- 110 002. (Fax:011-23235414 (Tele: 23237991 , 23236980 , 23235414,(e.mail: dg\\{,i?bl5 .gov.in). -- 1 of 18 -- 3. Director General of Foreign Trade, (Kind Attention : Shri